== BAND AND RULE STATE MACHINE =============================
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
| Field       | Value               | From  |
+=============+=====================+=======+
| leading band emits no dash before it      |
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
| two bands in a row                        |
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
| after band  | no dash before this | state |
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
| after rules | one dash only       | state |
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
| band after data gets a dash on both sides |
+-------------+---------------------+-------+
